---\nSuicides involving railways - Statistics | Eurostat\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"d0cf68a59d1e66b8\">>>", "url": "https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/TRAN_SF_RAILSU", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"b11a7d7b6aee197f\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nWe cannot provide a description for this page right now\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"b11a7d7b6aee197f\">>>", "siteName": "ec.europa.eu"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"3d76ac7679469c43\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nBehavioral and location‐related antecedents of train suicides - Moritz - 2023 - Suicide and Life-Threatening Behavior - Wiley Online Library\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"3d76ac7679469c43\">>>", "url": "https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1111/sltb.12941", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"482d1210450e54aa\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nIn the European Union, <strong>2204 suicides by train occurred in 2020</strong> (Eurostat, 2021).\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"482d1210450e54aa\">>>", "published": "January 30, 2023", "siteName": "onlinelibrary.wiley.com"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"884542709756988e\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n[tran_sf_railsu] Suicides involving railways\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"884542709756988e\">>>", "url": "https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/view/tran_sf_railsu", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"8b6a7e03326b38a1\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nWe cannot provide a description for this page right now\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"8b6a7e03326b38a1\">>>", "published": "January 13, 2026", "siteName": "ec.europa.eu"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"1b49496904f0ad9b\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nEU railway deaths fall in 2024\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"1b49496904f0ad9b\">>>", "url": "https://www.globalrailwayreview.com/news/233725/railway-deaths-in-the-eu-fall-in-2024-after-years-of-fluctuating-trends/", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"43d6fc487fba9eb0\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nThis follows two consecutive years of increases, after a steady declining trend from 2014 to 2019, when <strong>fatalities fell by around 22%</strong>. By the end of 2021, another sharp decrease of almost 15% compared with 2019 had been recorded.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"43d6fc487fba9eb0\">>>", "published": "December 17, 2025", "siteName": "www.globalrailwayreview.com"}]}, "isError": false, "timestamp": 1775286147325}}
